WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.966 --> 00:00:04.203
[thunder booming]

00:00:04.236 --> 00:00:07.874
- HI, YOU MUST BE LIAM.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:11.844
- HEY, BUDDY,
HOW ARE YOU FEELING TODAY?

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:15.415
- [hoarsely]
I'M FEELING FINE, DR. GUPTA.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.350
JUST FINE.

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:18.751
- THIS IS MARION GLASS,

00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:20.887
AND SHE'S FROM
THE MAKE A WISH FOUNDATION.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.723
- MARION GLASS.

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:26.159
- HOW ARE YOU
FEELING TODAY, LIAM?

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:30.063
- I'M FINE, MARION GLASS.
- GOOD.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:31.931
WELL, I HAVE SOME NEWS
THAT MIGHT MAKE YOU FEEL

00:00:31.964 --> 00:00:33.833
A LITTLE BETTER, HUH?

00:00:33.866 --> 00:00:37.036
WE AT THE MAKE A WISH FOUNDATION
MAKE DREAMS COME TRUE

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:41.908
FOR LITTLE BOYS AND LITTLE GIRLS
WHO ARE VERY SICK JUST LIKE YOU.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:46.813
- THERE ARE NO CHILDREN
LIKE ME, MARION GLASS.

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:48.981
- OH, OF COURSE NOT.

00:00:49.014 --> 00:00:51.651
YOU'RE ONE OF A KIND,
BUT WE'RE GONNA MAKE ANY DREAM

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:54.220
COME TRUE
THAT YOU COULD EVER HAVE, OKAY?

00:00:54.253 --> 00:00:55.721
- ANYTHING?

00:00:55.754 --> 00:00:58.291
- THAT'S RIGHT, BUDDY.
THAT'S RIGHT.

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:01.161
WOULD YOU LIKE TO PLAY WITH
YOUR FAVORITE BASKETBALL TEAM?

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:06.899
WHAT ABOUT BE SUPERMAN
FOR A DAY?

00:01:06.932 --> 00:01:10.002
- I WISH TO DROWN A MAN.

00:01:10.035 --> 00:01:13.005
[eerie music]

00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:14.040
♪ ♪

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:15.041
- WHAT?

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:19.178
- TO DROWN A MAN IN THE BATHTUB.

00:01:19.211 --> 00:01:22.448
TO HOLD HIM DOWN
WHILE THE LAST BREATH

00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:26.819
ESCAPES HIS BODY,
AND THEN BATHE IN THAT WATER,

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:28.454
ALL THE WHILE SINGING,

00:01:28.487 --> 00:01:32.492
♪ LA-LA, LA-LA ♪

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:34.827
♪ LA-LA, LA ♪

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.096
- LIAM.

00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:40.099
- YOU SAID ANYTHING.

00:01:40.132 --> 00:01:43.369
- WELL, S-SURELY WE DON'T WANT
TO HURT OTHER PEOPLE,

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:44.904
NOW, DO WE, KIDDO?

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:45.905
[both laugh uneasily]

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:47.373
ANYTHING ELSE?

00:01:47.406 --> 00:01:51.077
FLY IN A HOT AIR BALLOON
OR MEET A CELEBRITY?

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:55.781
- MY NEW WISH IS TO LEAN OVER
THE BODY OF A DYING MAN

00:01:55.814 --> 00:02:00.119
AND PUT MY LIPS ON HIS,
STEALING HIS LAST BREATH.

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:01.454
[inhales]

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:02.622
- LIAM.

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:04.690
- NO ONE WILL GET HURT.

00:02:04.723 --> 00:02:05.992
- ABSOLUTELY NOT.

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.827
I DON'T EVEN KNOW WHERE YOU--

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:11.797
- I WISH TO TAKE
ALL THE PROSTHETIC LEGS

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:15.968
IN THE HOSPITAL
AND BIND THEM TOGETHER

00:02:16.001 --> 00:02:19.138
WITH THE DRIED FLESH
OF THE DEAD

00:02:19.171 --> 00:02:24.610
INTO A WEBBED MASSIVE CREATURE,
AND--

00:02:24.643 --> 00:02:26.479
- LIAM!

00:02:26.512 --> 00:02:29.215
I AM SO SORRY, MS. GLASS.
- IT'S ALL RIGHT.

00:02:29.248 --> 00:02:31.317
HE--HE DOESN'T KNOW
WHAT HE'S SAYING.

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.186
- I WISH TO PEE
IN YOUR MOUTH.

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:34.954
- WHAT?
- BOTH OF YOU.

00:02:34.987 --> 00:02:35.988
- MINE?

00:02:36.021 --> 00:02:37.990
- ESPECIALLY YOU.
- OH.

00:02:38.023 --> 00:02:41.394
- I WISH TO PEE
IN BOTH OF YOUR MOUTHS

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:43.062
AS I STAND OVER YOU.

00:02:43.095 --> 00:02:45.865
I'LL NEED A GLASS OF WATER
IN TEN MINUTES.

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:47.066
- ENOUGH,
YOU LITTLE [bleep]!

00:02:47.099 --> 00:02:48.334
- DR. GUPTA!

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:49.969
- NO.

00:02:50.002 --> 00:02:51.137
YOU ARE REPREHENSIBLE.

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:53.239
YOU ARE EVIL.

00:02:53.272 --> 00:02:55.208
YOU ARE A DEVIL CHILD.

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:56.609
- [whimpering]

00:02:56.642 --> 00:02:58.477
- DR. GUPTA,
HE'S NOT A DEVIL CHILD.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:00.112
HE'S JUST A CHILD.

00:03:00.145 --> 00:03:02.048
YOU HAVE NO BUSINESS WORKING
IN A PEDIATRIC WARD.

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:03.749
- WHAT?
- I'M GONNA REPORT YOU.

00:03:03.782 --> 00:03:06.285
- [crying]

00:03:06.318 --> 00:03:07.353
[door slams]

00:03:09.521 --> 00:03:14.160
- ♪ SHAME ON YOU, GUPTA ♪

00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:18.531
♪ SHAME ON YOU, GUPTA ♪

00:03:18.564 --> 00:03:22.335
YOU REALLY UPSET
MARION GLASS.

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:27.206
- THIS IS INSANE.

00:03:27.239 --> 00:03:30.042
YOU'VE MADE ME QUESTION
EVERYTHING THAT I'VE EVER

00:03:30.075 --> 00:03:34.680
BELIEVED ABOUT THE
ESSENTIAL GOODNESS OF CHILDREN.

00:03:34.713 --> 00:03:39.986
- WISH GRANTED.

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:43.489
[flatlining]

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:58.871
- [gasps]
- [giggles]

00:03:58.904 --> 00:04:00.306
I AM DYING THOUGH.

00:04:00.339 --> 00:04:01.339
[flatlining]

